## Best Practices
- Use var for implicit typing when type is evident
- Prefer pattern matching over traditional if-else chains
- Use switch expressions for concise conditional logic
- Implement proper disposal patterns with IDisposable
- Use ConfigureAwait(false) in library code
- Apply guard clauses for parameter validation
- Use specific exception types for different error conditions
- Write XML documentation for all public APIs
- Enable nullable reference types for better null safety
- Use modern collection initializers and expressions
